# Build context of infra/docker/web.Dockerfile (the repository root). The API and agents images build from their
# own folders and are not affected. Keep local env files, data and other apps out of the website images.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.local
**/*.db
**/.venv
**/build
**/.dart_tool
.git
.github
.claude
docs
infra
mobile
services
firebase/*
!firebase/package.json
